discussion_id":"72ec01dfefb7e2aa30b289dd4341596ecf0e36f0","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-20T14:44:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-20T14:44:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160559331,"discussion_id":"3d6a99004f62ee0dbf925705d99065859b74655d","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复MoE路由最终化算子中，当特定数据块（Db0, Db2）为有效行但处于特定丢弃填充模式（MODE_VALUE_1 或 MODE_VALUE_3）时，未正确应用偏置（Bias）或零值初始化的问题。该问题可能导致在特定条件下，部分数据路径的计算结果不正确，影响模型的最终输出精度。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在 `Compute` 函数中，修正了对数据块 `expandedPermutedTmpUbDb0` 和 `expandedPermutedTmpUbDb2` 的处理逻辑。原先逻辑仅在数据块为无效行且处于特定丢弃填充模式时将其置零。修改后，当数据块为有效行时，也增加了对应的处理分支：若模板参数 `ISBIASEXIST` 为真，则与偏置张量相加；否则执行加零操作。这确保了所有数据路径在处理偏置和初始化时逻辑的一致性，消除了条件分支遗漏。","created_at":"2026-01-20T14:44:45+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-20T14:44:45+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160560495,"discussion_id":"d5583083c8e400379a8ec212c93771e707581605","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-01-20T14:50:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-20T14:50:44+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c639e4b985165b4b0565","login":"yangyidiao","object_id":"6822c639e4b985165b4b0565","name":"yangyidiao","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yangyidiao"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160560738,"discussion_id":"a42aa0aa7a26135275edb4d3f250fce60df0f532","body":"流水线任务触发成功，任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipeli